        "grs_faq_city_h_html": "Glass railings in [city]: common questions",
        "grs_faq_city_q1_html": "Do you ship glass railings to [city]?",
        "grs_faq_city_a1_html": "<p>Yes. We ship glass railing systems to [city] and across [country]. [shipping] The price displayed at checkout is the final price with no hidden fees, tariffs, or duties, even if the order crosses borders between the US and Canada.</p>",
        "grs_faq_city_q2_html": "What building code applies to glass railings in [city]?",
        "grs_faq_city_a2_html": "<p>Glass railings in [city] have to meet the building code in force in [region], along with any local requirements from your city or county. Our [code_link] guide covers the rules for guards and railings. Ensure compliance with local building codes before you order and install.</p>",
        "grs_faq_city_a2_ca_html": "<p>Glass railings in [city] have to meet the building code that [region] adopts from the National Building Code of Canada, plus any municipal requirements. Our [code_link] guide covers the rules for guards and railings. Ensure compliance with local building codes before you order and install.</p>",
        "grs_faq_city_q3_html": "Which glass railing heights are available in [city]?",
        "grs_faq_city_a3_html": "<p>Our 12mm tempered glass panels come in four heights: 33.6\", 39.6\", 46\" and 57.7\", for a total railing height of 36\", 42\", 48\" or 60\" once the panel sits in the spigot. The 33.6\", 39.6\" and 46\" panels come in 36 widths starting at 7.9\". The 57.7\" panels come in 33.6\", 39.6\" and 46\" widths.</p>",
        "grs_faq_city_q4_html": "Can I install the glass railing myself?",
        "grs_faq_city_a4_html": "<p>Yes. Installation is easy and customer friendly: the spigots fix to wood or concrete and the 12mm tempered glass panels set into them. Follow our <a href=\"/pages/glass-railing-installation-guide\">glass railing installation guide</a> and installation video before you start.</p>",
        "grs_faq_city_q5_html": "How do I get a quote for a glass railing in [city]?",
        "grs_faq_city_a5_html": "<p>Submit a plan request with your measurements, photos or drawings and we will send you a detailed quote on the materials necessary for your project. You can also call or text <a href=\"tel:+18554527715\">(855) 452-7715</a>.</p>",
        "grs_faq_hub_h_html": "Glass railings in [region]: common questions",
        "grs_faq_hub_q1_html": "Do you deliver glass railings across [region]?",
        "grs_faq_hub_a1_html": "<p>Yes. We ship glass railing systems to homes and businesses across [region]. [shipping] Free shipping for glass railing orders over $3,000.</p>",
        "grs_faq_hub_q2_html": "Where can I find the [region] building code for glass railings?",
        "grs_faq_hub_a2_html": "<p>Our [code_link] guide explains the requirements for guards and railings in [region]. Ensure compliance with local building codes before you order and install.</p>",
        "grs_faq_hub_q3_html": "What is included in a frameless glass railing system?",
        "grs_faq_hub_a3_html": "<p>A frameless system uses 12mm tempered glass panels held by 2205 marine grade stainless steel spigots, with connectors between panels, optional caprail, and gate hardware for gates. <a href=\"/collections/glass-railing\">Browse all products</a>.</p>",
        "grs_faq_hub_q4_html": "Can the glass railing withstand strong winds?",
        "grs_faq_hub_a4_html": "<p>Yes. The glass guardrails are engineered to withstand very strong winds and weather conditions, with proven performance even in extreme environments.</p>",
        "grs_faq_hub_q5_html": "How do I get a quote for my project in [region]?",
        "grs_faq_hub_a5_html": "<p>Submit a plan request with your measurements, photos or drawings and we will send you a detailed quote on the materials necessary for your project. You can also call or text <a href=\"tel:+18554527715\">(855) 452-7715</a>.</p>",
        "grs_faq_code_h_html": "[region] glass railing code: common questions",
        "grs_faq_code_q1_html": "Do I need a permit for a glass railing in [region]?",
        "grs_faq_code_a1_html": "<p>Permit requirements depend on your municipality and the scope of the project. Check with your local building department before you order. Ensure compliance with local building codes before you order and install.</p>",
        "grs_faq_code_q2_html": "Do you have engineering documents for inspectors?",
        "grs_faq_code_a2_html": "<p>Yes. Our <a href=\"/pages/glass-railing-engineering-testing\">engineering documents</a> cover top mount and side mount spigots on concrete and wood, with drawings, load applications and blocking details.</p>",
        "grs_faq_code_q3_html": "Which glass railing heights do you sell?",
        "grs_faq_code_a3_html": "<p>Our 12mm tempered glass panels come in four heights: 33.6\", 39.6\", 46\" and 57.7\", for a total railing height of 36\", 42\", 48\" or 60\" once the panel sits in the spigot.</p>",
        "grs_faq_code_q4_html": "Do you ship glass railings to [region]?",
        "grs_faq_code_a4_html": "<p>Yes. [shipping] See our [hub_link] page for the cities we serve.</p>",
