        "grs_faq_us_q2_html": "Are there hidden fees, tariffs, or duties on U.S. orders?",
        "grs_faq_us_a2_html": "<p>No. The price displayed at checkout is the final price with no hidden fees, tariffs, or duties, even if the order crosses borders between the US and Canada.</p>",
